        "content": "\n          <p>Examine the operational contrasts between mature, considerate campus behaviors and common student mistakes regarding culture shock: adapting to campus freedom without losing yourself:</p>\n          <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n            <table class=\"data-table\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <th>Evaluation Dimension</th>\n                  <th>Recommended Best Practice</th>\n                  <th>Common High-Risk Pitfall</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Dating Pacing</strong></td>\n                  <td>Takes several months to evaluate partner character and values.</td>\n                  <td>Rushes into high-intensity dating during orientation week.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Senior Advances</strong></td>\n                  <td>Sets firm boundaries and avoids transactional campus perks.</td>\n                  <td>Trades personal boundaries for academic favors or lodge rides.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Academic Priority</strong></td>\n                  <td>Focuses on securing a high 100-level CGPA and study routine.</td>\n                  <td>Skips foundational lectures and tutorials for romantic dates.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Peer Support</strong></td>\n                  <td>Cultivates genuine coursemate friendships and study circles.</td>\n                  <td>Isolates exclusively with a partner and ignores campus friends.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Personal Autonomy</strong></td>\n                  <td>Maintains independence, finances, and personal agency.</td>\n                  <td>Allows an older partner to dictate personal decisions and style.</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n  "
