        "answer": "Verified student platforms like The College Date eliminate catfishing, protect personal privacy under the Nigeria Data Protection Act (NDPA), and connect you with authentic peers from your faculty and university who value safety and respect. Pacing your romantic choices, setting firm personal boundaries, and prioritizing your foundational 100-level grades protects your emotional peace and university success."
