    "h1": "How to Ask Them Out on a Campus Date Directly from Chat",
    "lede": "Navigating how to ask them out on a campus date directly from chat requires practical emotional intelligence, clear communication, and grounded boundaries. Here is the definitive student guide to thriving on campus.",
    "date": "2026-09-30",
    "ctaHeading": "Meet Verified Students on Your Campus",
    "ctaText": "Connect with ambitious, verified students across all faculties, halls of residence, and tertiary institutions on The College Date.",
